        {"zh": "别这样", "en": "Do not."},
        {"zh": "我记得有人这样抱过我", "en": "I remember someone holding me like that."},
        {"zh": "那是很久以前了", "en": "That was a long time ago."},
        {"zh": "我什么都不剩", "en": "There is nothing left of me."},
        {"zh": "你别难过", "en": "Do not be sad."},
        {"zh": "我只是个影子", "en": "I am only a shadow."},
        {"zh": "让我待一会儿", "en": "Let me stay a while."}
