        {"zh": "我等太久了", "en": "I have waited too long."},
        {"zh": "我知道我拦不住你", "en": "I know I cannot stop you."},
        {"zh": "但我还是会试", "en": "But I will try anyway."},
        {"zh": "我的声音变了", "en": "My voice changed."},
        {"zh": "这里很冷，对吧", "en": "It is cold here, is it not?"},
        {"zh": "你的心跳太快了", "en": "Your heart is beating too fast."},
